    Annotation {
      Name          "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-sty"
"le:italic;\">Q integral Loop: </span>The dVOC provides only proportional V-Q "
"Droop, which leaves a steady-state error, which</p>\n<p>is actived after the "
"closure ringing.</p></body></html>"
      Position      [2305, 265]
    } 
    Annotation {
      Name          "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-sty"
"le:italic;\">Virtual Damping: </span>Both Rv_damp and Kad are used to damp th"
"e LCL resonance. </p></body></html>"
      Position      [2235, 205]
    } 
    Annotation {
      Name          "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-sty"
"le:italic;\">P feedforward: </span>The P channel has no integral action, so t"
"he resistive drop between the oscillator node and</p>\n<p>the PCC would remai"
"n uncorrected</p></body></html>"
      Position      [2305, 295]
    } 
    Annotation {
      Name          "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-sty"
"le:italic;\">Timeline:</span></p>\n<p>0.00 s   Black start from vc0, open cir"
"cuit</p>\n<p>0.50 s   Rload1 (30 MW) connects;  P* = 29 MW</p>\n<p>0.90 s   P"
"re-synchronization ON</p>\n<p>1.50 s   Grid breaker closes</p>\n<p>1.60 s   Q"
" integral loop armed</p>\n<p>1.65 s   Pre-synchronization OFF</p>\n<p>2.30 s "
"  End of simulation</p>\n<p> </p></body></html>"
      Position      [2155, 385]
    } 
    Annotation {
      Name          "<html><body>\n<p>While islanded, P is set by the load, no"
"t by P*: the step at 0.90 s is the load drawing more as</p>\n<p>pre-synchroni"
"zation raises the PCC voltage to nominal, and P* acts on the frequency instea"
"d</p></body></html>"
      Position      [2275, 465]
    } 
